WEBVTT

NOTE Captions follow the spoken voiceover. Titles burned into the picture are shortened scene labels and are not this script.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500 line:8%
Getting noticed is only the beginning.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:08.800 line:8%
A patient searches, compares, reads reviews, and decides who to trust.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.600 line:8%
Your marketing brought them to you, but when the phone rings,

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.100 line:8%
your team may already be helping someone else.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:28.200 line:8%
Hi, I'm Aria, the practice's AI assistant.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:30.200 line:8%
How can I help you today?

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.900 line:8%
Aria helps answer calls and supports the conversation when your team is busy,

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.100 line:8%
but answering is only one part of the journey.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.900 line:8%
The website, appointment availability, scheduling, and follow-through all shape what happens next.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:57.500 line:8%
When every part works together, your practice can turn more opportunities into better patient experiences.

00:00:58.400 --> 00:00:59.700 line:8%
Velzyx and Aria.
